self","to":"bldg"}]},"exp":{"result":"{x|Expense} in profit or loss","body":["Not needed to bring the asset to working condition, so it is not part of any asset’s cost."]},"land":{"result":"{a|Land} (not depreciated)","body":["Part of acquiring and preparing the plot.","! Deduct salvage proceeds from demolition."]},"li":{"result":"{a|Land improvements} (depreciated)","body":["The road wears out, so it is a {a|land improvement}: capitalised and depreciated over its own useful life. Together with the fence and sprinklers: $440,000."]},"bldg":{"result":"{a|Building} (depreciated)","body":["The structure itself, a separate asset with its own useful life."]}},"sect":1,"part":"Classify","svg":"\u003csvg width=\"100%\" style=\"min-width:480px\" role=\"img\"\n viewBox=\"0.00 0.00 436.00 373.00\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n\u003cg id=\"graph0\" class=\"graph\" transform=\"scale(1 1) rotate(0) translate(10.8 362.58)\">\n\u003ctitle>G\u003c/title>\n\u003cpolygon fill=\"white\" stroke=\"none\" points=\"-10.8,10.8 -10.8,-362.58 424.7,-362.58 424.7,10.8 -10.8,10.8\"/>\n\n\u003cg id=\"node1\" class=\"node\">\n\u003ctitle>c1\u003c/title>\n\u003cpath fill=\"#fef3c7\" stroke=\"#b45309\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" d=\"M334.9,-351.78C334.9,-351.78 208.88,-351.78 208.88,-351.78 202.88,-351.78 196.88,-345.78 196.88,-339.78 196.88,-339.78 196.88,-319.14 196.88,-319.14 196.88,-313.14 202.88,-307.14 208.88,-307.14 208.88,-307.14 334.9,-307.14 334.9,-307.14 340.9,-307.14 346.9,-313.14 346.9,-319.14 346.9,-319.14 346.9,-339.78 346.9,-339.78 346.9,-345.78 340.9,-351.78 334.9,-351.78\"/>\n\u003ctext xml:space=\"preserve\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"271.89\" y=\"-337.01\" font-family=\"Helvetica,sans-Serif\" font-size=\"11.00\" fill=\"#111827\">Is the cost needed to get an\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext xml:space=\"preserve\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"271.89\" y=\"-325.01\" font-family=\"Helvetica,sans-Serif\" font-size=\"11.00\" fill=\"#111827\">asse