text xml:space=\"preserve\" text-anchor=\"start\" x=\"186.78\" y=\"-153.03\" font-family=\"Helvetica,sans-Serif\" font-size=\"10.00\" fill=\"#166534\"> (as 1&#45;16)\u003c/text>\n\u003c/g>\n\n\u003cg id=\"edge3\" class=\"edge\">\n\u003ctitle>ip&#45;&gt;ppe\u003c/title>\n\u003cpath fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6b7280\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,2\" d=\"M260.65,-88.06C219.42,-91.47 163.99,-97.93 116.28,-109.94 107.87,-112.05 99.11,-114.86 90.7,-117.9\"/>\n\u003cpolygon fill=\"#6b7280\" stroke=\"#6b7280\" points=\"90.04,-115.9 85.15,-119.96 91.51,-119.84 90.04,-115.9\"/>\n\u003ctext xml:space=\"preserve\" text-anchor=\"start\" x=\"136.15\" y=\"-122.94\" font-family=\"Helvetica,sans-Serif\" font-size=\"10.00\" fill=\"#374151\">owner moves in:\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext xml:space=\"preserve\" text-anchor=\"start\" x=\"131.65\" y=\"-111.69\" font-family=\"Helvetica,sans-Serif\" font-size=\"10.00\" fill=\"#374151\">FV = deemed cost\u003c/text>\n\u003c/g>\n\n\u003cg id=\"node3\" class=\"node\">\n\u003ctitle>inv\u003c/title>\n\u003cpath fill=\"#e8eef6\" stroke=\"#1f3a5f\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" d=\"M63.03,-47.44C63.03,-47.44 20.25,-47.44 20.25,-47.44 14.25,-47.44 8.25,-41.44 8.25,-35.44 8.25,-35.44 8.25,-23.44 8.25,-23.44 8.25,-17.44 14.25,-11.44 20.25,-11.44 20.25,-11.44 63.03,-11.44 63.03,-11.44 69.03,-11.44 75.03,-17.44 75.03,-23.44 75.03,-23.44 75.03,-35.44 75.03,-35.44 75.03,-41.44 69.03,-47.44 63.03,-47.44\"/>\n\u003ctext xml:space=\"preserve\" text-anchor=\"start\" x=\"16.89\" y=\"-25.99\" font-family=\"Helvetica,sans-Serif\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"11.00\" fill=\"#111827\">Inventory\u003c/text>\n\u003c/g>\n\n\u003cg id=\"edge4\" class=\"edge\">\n\u003ctitle>ip&#45;&gt;inv\u003c/title>\n\u003cpath fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6b7280\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,2\" d=\"M305.87,-65.93C288.88,-47.44 259.9,-20.2 228.03,-8.94 179.88,8.07 120.71,-3.65 82.36,-15.16\"/>\n\u003cpolygon fill=\"#6b7280\" stroke=\"#6b7280\" points=\"82.01,-13.07 76.9,-16.85 83.25,-17.08 82.01,-13.07\"/>\n\u003ctext xml:space=\"preserve\" text-anchor=\"start\" x=\"125.28\" y=\"-21.94\" font-family=\"Helvetica,sans-Serif\" font-size=\"10.00\" fill=\"#374151\">development for sale:\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext xml:space=\"preserve\" text-anchor=\"start\" x=\"131.65\" y=\"-10.69\" font-family=\"Helvetica,sans-Serif\" font-size=\"10.00\" fill=\"#374151\">FV = deemed cost\u003c/text>\n\u003c/g>\n\n\u003cg id=\"edge2\" class=\"edge\">\n\u003ctitle>inv&#45;&gt;ip\u003c/title>\n\u003cpath fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#b45309\" d=\"M75.59,-34.41C112.76,-40.18 174.96,-50.34 228.03,-61.44 236.28,-63.16 244.9,-65.09 253.43,-67.09\"/>\n\u003cpolygon fill=\"#b45309\" stroke=\"#b45309\" points=\"252.77,-69.1 259.1,-68.43 253.74,-65.01 252.77,-69.1\"/>\n\u003ctext xml:space=\"preserve\" text-anchor=\"start\" x=\"123.78\" y=\"-72.94\" font-family=\"Helvetica,sans-Serif\" font-size=\"10.00\" fill=\"#b45309\">operating lease starts:\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext xml:space=\"preserve\" text-anchor=\"start\" x=\"132.78\" y=\"-62.94\" font-family=\"Helvetica,sans-Serif\" font-size=\"10.00\" fill=\"#b45309\">difference → \u003c/text>\n\u003ctext xml:space=\"preserve\" text-anchor=\"start\" x=\"191.28\" y=\"-62.94\" font-family=\"Helvetica,sans-Serif\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"10.00\" fill=\"#b45309\">P&amp;L\u003c/text>\n\u003c/g>\n\u003c/g>\n\u003c/svg>\n"},{"id":"tree-1mkjka","type":"tree","bucket":"derecognise","lo":18,"title":"How is this transfer recorded?","scenario":"Lim Holdings moves out of its office building ({a|PPE}, {a|carrying amount} $800,000) and leases it to a tenant. Fair value at that date is $950,000. Lim uses the fair value model for investment property.","expect":"ppeUp","start":"t1","nodes":{"t1":{"q":"Which model does the entity use for investment property?","why":"Under the cost model nothing is ever remeasured, so transfers are simple.","opts":[{"t":"Cost model","to":"cost"},{"t":"Fair value model","to":"t2"}]},"t2":{"q":"Has the use actually changed, with evidence?","why":"A transfer follows a change in use, not a change of plan.","opts":[{"t":"Only management’s intention has changed","to":"none"},{"t":"Yes, the use has changed","to":"t3"}]},"t3":{"q":"Which way is the property moving?","why":"Into investment property, the gain’s home depends on where it came from. Out of it, fair value becomes the new cost.","opts":[{"t":"PPE → IP: the owner moves out","to":"t4"},{"t":"Inventory → IP: an operating lease starts","to":"invIp"},{"t":"IP → PPE: the owner moves in","to":"ipPpe"},{"t":"IP → inventory: development with a view to sale starts","to":"ipInv"},{"t":"IP to be sold as it is, with no development","to":"stay"}]},"t4":{"q":"At the date of change, is fair value above or below the {a|carrying amount}?","why":"PPE → IP is treated like a PPE revaluation, and the revaluation rules treat ups and downs differently.","opts":[{"t":"Above","to":"ppeUp"},{"t":"Below","to":"ppeDown"}]},"cost":{"result":"Transfer at carrying amount","body":["Under the cost model, transfers in any direction are at the **{a|carrying amount}**. No {i|gain} or {x|loss} arises."]},"none":{"result":"No transfer","body":["A change in intention alone is not evidence of a change in use. The property stays where it is until the use actually changes."]},"ppeUp":{"result":"PPE → IP: increase to the {e|revaluation surplus} (OCI)","body":["Depreciate the building up to the date of change, then measure it at fair value. The increase of {e|150,000} (950,000 − {a|carrying amount} 800,000) is treated as a PPE revaluation.","> Dr {a|Investment property} 950,000, Dr {a|Accumulated depreciation: building} 200,000 / Cr {a|Building (PPE)} 1,000,000, Cr {e|Revaluation surplus (OCI)} 150,000","- Later fair value changes are {i|gains} or {x|losses} in **profit or loss**."]},"ppeDown":{"result":"PPE → IP: decrease to profit or loss","body":["A decrease is a {x|loss} in **profit or loss**, unless that building has a {e|revaluation surplus} from earlier PPE revaluations: then it uses that up in OCI first."]},"invIp":{"result":"Inventory → IP: difference to profit or loss","body":["Fair value at the date of change minus the {a|inventory’s carrying amount} is a {i|gain} in **profit or loss**: it is the profit the entity would have made selling it."]},"ipPpe":{"result":"IP → PPE: fair value is deemed cost","body":["Remeasure to fair value at the date of change (difference to P&L, as for any fair value change). That fair value becomes the **{a|PPE’s deemed cost}**, and {x|depreciation} starts from there."]},"ipInv":{"result":"IP → inventory: fair value is deemed cost","body":["Fair value at the date of change becomes the **{a|inventory’s deemed cost}**. Later it is carried at the lower of cost and NRV."]},"stay":{"result":"It stays investment property","body":["A decision to sell without development is not a change in use. The property stays {a|investment property}, at fair value, until it is derecognised. It is **not** moved to {a|inventory}."]}},"sect":5,"part":"Derecognise / transfer","svg":"\u003csvg width=\"100%\" style=\"min-width:640px\" role=\"img\"\n viewBox=\"0.00 0.00 826.00 417.00\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n\u003cg id=\"graph0\" class=\"graph\" transform=\"scale(1 1) rotate(0) translate(10.8 406.19)\">\n\u003ctitle>G\u003c/title>\n\u003cpolygon fill=\"white\" stroke=\"none\" points=\"-10.8,10.8 -10.8,-406.19 814.7,-406.19 814.7,10.8 -10.8,10.8\"/>\n\n\u003cg id=\"node1\" class=\"node\">\n\u003ctitle>t1\u003c/title>\n\u003cpath fill=\"#fef3c7\" stroke=\"#b45309\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" d=\"M656.9,-395.39C656.9,-395.39 527.12,-395.39 527.12,-395.39 521.12,-395.39 515.12,-389.39 515.12,-383.39 515.12,-383.39 515.12,-371.39 515.12,-371.39 515.12,-365.39 521.12,-359.39 527.12,-359.39 527.12,-359.39 656.9,-359.39 656.9,-359.39 662.9,-359.39 668.9,-365.39 668.9,-371.39 668.9,-371.39 668.9,-383.39 668.9,-383.39 668.9,-389.39 662.9,-395.39 656.9,-395.39\"/>\n\u003ctext xml:space=\"preserve\" text-ancho