7280\" points=\"213.89,-37.82 207.57,-37.13 212.08,-41.61 213.89,-37.82\"/>\n\u003c/g>\n\u003c/g>\n\u003c/svg>\n"},{"type":"rule","bucket":"derecognise","lo":21,"title":"Recycling: debt yes, equity never","body":["1. **FVOCI debt:** on derecognition the cumulative {e|OCI balance} is **reclassified (recycled) to P&L**.","2. **FVOCI equity:** the cumulative {e|OCI balance} is **never** recycled. It may be transferred within equity: Dr {e|Fair value reserve (OCI)}, Cr {e|Retained earnings}.","3. **Amortised cost:** {i|gain} or {x|loss} = {a|proceeds} − {a|amortised cost}, to P&L.","! Recycling an equity FVOCI gain into profit is a classic distractor."],"id":"rule-1d1hns","sect":5,"part":"Derecognise / transfer"},{"type":"diagram","bucket":"derecognise","lo":21,"title":"The recycling rule: debt vs equity at FVOCI","intro":"Two FVOCI assets are sold. Where does the gain sitting in OCI end up?","notes":{"sold":"Both FVOCI categories build up fair value gains in the {e|Fair value reserve (OCI)}. On derecognition the question is whether that balance goes through profit.","kind":"Check which FVOCI it is. Debt got there through the business model; equity got there by an irrevocable election.","debt":"The bond carried at fair value 99,000 with 833 in the {e|reserve}, sold for 99,000.","eq":"Shares elected FVOCI at 20,300 (brokerage capitalised), sold for 22,000: a cumulative gain of 1,700 sits in OCI.","rec":"Debt: the {e|reserve} is **reclassified** to P&L. Dr {e|Fair value reserve (OCI)} 833, Cr {i|Gain on disposal (P&L)} 833. Profit ends up the same as amortised cost would give.","never":"Equity: **never** recycled. That is the price of the election: the gains stay out of profit forever, and the P&L effect of the sale is nil.","re":"Allowed, not required: Dr {e|Fair value reserve (OCI)} 1,700, Cr {e|Retained earnings} 1,700. A move within equity, not through profit."},"walk":[{"nodes":["sold","kind"],"text":"An FVOCI asset is sold. First ask: debt or equity?"},{"nodes":["debt","rec"],"text":"**Debt:** the $833 in OCI is **recycled** to P&L."},{"nodes":["eq","never"],"text":"**Equity:** the $1,700 is **never** recycled. The sale has no effect on profit."},{"nodes":["never","re"],"text":"The {e|equity reserve} may be moved to {e|retained earnings}, inside equity only."}],"caption":"Debt: recycled. Equity: never.","id":"diagram-v6y852","sect":5,"part":"Derecognise / transfer","svg":"\u003csvg width=\"100%\" style=\"min-width:330px\" role=\"img\"\n viewBox=\"0.00 0.00 300.00 327.00\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n\u003cg id=\"graph0\" class=\"graph\" transform=\"scale(1 1) rotate(0) translate(14.4 312.65)\">\n\u003ctitle>G\u003c/title>\n\u003cpolygon fill=\"white\" stroke=\"none\" points=\"-14.4,14.4 -14.4,-312.65 285.18,-312.65 285.18,14.4 -14.4,14.4\"/>\n\n\u003cg id=\"node1\" class=\"node\">\n\u003ctitle>sold\u003c/title>\n\u003cpath fill=\"#1f3a5f\" stroke=\"#1f3a5f\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" d=\"M190.78,-298.25C190.78,-298.25 55.75,-298.25 55.75,-298.25 49.75,-298.25 43.75,-292.25 43.75,-286.25 43.75,-286.25 43.75,-274.25 43.75,-274.25 43.75,-268.25 49.75,-262.25 55.75,-262.25 55.75,-262.25 190.78,-262.25 190.78,-262.25 196.78,-262.25 202.78,-268.25 202.78,-274.25 202.78,-274.25 202.78,-286.25 202.78,-286.25 202.78,-292.25 196.78,-298.25 190.78,-298.25\"/>\n\u003ctext xml:space=\"preserve\" text-anchor=\"start\" x=\"78.27\" y=\"-280.8\" font-family=\"Helvetica,sans-Serif\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"11.00\" fill=\"white\">FVOCI asset sold\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext xml:space=\"preserve\" text-anchor=\"start\" x=\"52.39\" y=\"-271.7\" font-family=\"Helvetica,sans-Serif\" font-size=\"9.00\" fill=\"white\">gain sitting in the fair value reserve\u003c/text>\n\u003c/g>\n\n\u003cg id=\"node2\" class=\"node\">\n\u003ctitle>kind\u003c/title>\n\u003cpath fill=\"#fef3c7\" stroke=\"#b45309\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" d=\"M156.66,-235.25C156.66,-235.25 89.88,-235.25 89.88,-235.25 83.88,-235.25 77.8