"t":"Yes: the event has happened and settling can’t realistically be avoided","to":"n2"},{"t":"Not yet clear, and it is less likely than not that we owe anything: only a **possible** obligation","to":"n3"},{"t":"No: it is only a plan, an intention or a future event","to":"none"}]},"n2":{"q":"Where does the outflow sit on the likelihood scale?","why":"One scale, three bands: above 50% is probable (recognise), very unlikely is remote (nothing), and everything in between is possible (disclose).","opts":[{"t":"Probable: more likely than not, above 50%","to":"n4"},{"t":"Possible: a real chance, but not more likely than not","to":"cl"},{"t":"Remote: very unlikely","to":"none"}]},"n3":{"q":"A possible obligation can never be a {l|provision}. Is the outflow **remote**?","why":"Whether the obligation exists uses the same 50% test. Below it, the best you can get is disclosure, and remote items aren’t even disclosed.","opts":[{"t":"Yes, very unlikely","to":"none"},{"t":"No, it is a real possibility","to":"cl"}]},"n4":{"q":"Can a **reliable estimate** be made?","why":"Almost always yes: a range of outcomes is enough to estimate. Only in extremely rare cases is no estimate possible.","opts":[{"t":"Yes (almost always)","to":"prov"},{"t":"No (extremely rare)","to":"cl"}]},"prov":{"result":"Recognise a {l|provision}","body":["> Dr {x|Legal claims expense}, Cr {l|Provision for legal claims}","- Measure at the **best estimate**. One lawsuit is a single obligation, so the **most likely outcome** is the starting point: here $400,000.","- Review it at every reporting date. Disclose the reconciliation of movements and the uncertainties."]},"cl":{"result":"Contingent liability: disclose only","body":["- Nothing goes in the statement of financial position.","- In the notes: the nature of it and, where practicable, an estimate of the financial effect, the uncertainties and any possible reimbursement.","- Reassess each year: if the outflow becomes probable, recognise a {l|provision} in that year."]},"none":{"result":"Nothing: no {l|liability}, no disclosure","body":["- Either there is no obligation at all (only a plan), or the outflow is remote.","! Don’t disclose remote contingent liabilities."]}},"id":"tree-1fa1bl","sect":2,"part":"Classify · provision or contingent?","svg":"\u003csvg width=\"100%\" style=\"min-width:640px\" role=\"img\"\n viewBox=\"0.00 0.00 584.00 406.00\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n\u003cg id=\"graph0\" class=\"graph\" transform=\"scale(1 1) rotate(0) translate(10.8 394.83)\">\n\u003ctitle>G\u003c/title>\n\u003cpolygon fill=\"white\" stroke=\"none\" points=\"-10.8,10.8 -10.8,-394.83 572.92,-394.83 572.92,10.8 -10.8,10.8\"/>\n\n\u003cg id=\"node1\" class=\"node\">\n\u003ctitle>n1\u003c/title>\n\u003cpath fill=\"#fef3c7\" stroke=\"#b45309\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" d=\"M433.78,-384.03C433.78,-384.03 315.25,-384.03 315.25,-384.03 309.25,-384.03 303.25,-378.03 303.25,-372.03 303.25,-372.03 303.25,-339.39 303.25,-339.39 303.25,-333.39 309.25,-327.39 315.25,-327.39 315.25,-327.39 433.78,-327.39 433.78,-327.39 439.78,-327.39 445.78,-333.39 445.78,-339.39 445.78,-339.39 445.78,-372.03 445.78,-372.03 445.78,-378.03 439.78,-384.03 433.78,-384.03\"/>\n\u003ctext xml:space=\"preserve\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"374.51\" y=\"-369.26\" font-family=\"Helvetica,sans-Serif\" font-size=\"11.00\" fill=\"#111827\">Is there a present\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext xml:space=\"preserve\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"374.51\" y=\"-357.26\" font-family=\"Helvetica,sans-Serif\" font-size=\"11.00\" fill=\"#111827\">obligation (legal or\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext xml:space=\"preserve\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"374.51\" y=\"-345.26\" font-family=\"Helvetica,sans-Serif\" font-size=\"11.00\" fill=\"#111827\">constructive) as a result of\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext xml:space=\"preserve\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"374.51\" y=\"-333.26\" font-family=\"Helvetica,sans-Serif\" font-size=\"11.00\" fill=\"#111827\">a past event