ify","lo":35,"title":"Classifying a financial liability","start":"n1","nodes":{"n1":{"q":"Must the entity deliver cash (or another financial asset) under a contract?","why":"Only a contractual obligation to pay cash is a {l|financial liability}. Everything else is {e|equity} or a {l|non-financial liability}.","opts":[{"t":"Yes: {l|loans}, {l|bonds}, {l|payables}, {l|redeemable prefs}, {l|derivatives}","to":"trade"},{"t":"No: only a residual interest ({e|ordinary shares})","to":"eq"},{"t":"No: it owes goods, services, or an obligation imposed by law","to":"nf"}]},"trade":{"q":"Is it held for trading (for example {l|a derivative with a negative fair value})?","why":"{l|Trading liabilities} live on price moves, so fair value through P&L is the only meaningful measure.","opts":[{"t":"Yes","to":"fvtpl"},{"t":"No","to":"des"}]},"des":{"q":"Did the entity irrevocably designate it at FVTPL when it was first recognised?","why":"The designation is the only other route to FVTPL, and it is available on day one only.","opts":[{"t":"No (the usual case)","to":"ac"},{"t":"Yes","to":"fvd"}]},"ac":{"result":"Amortised cost (the default)","body":["Initial: {l|fair value} **minus** transaction costs.","- {x|Interest expense} = {l|opening carrying amount} × effective rate.","- {l|Premium} or {l|discount} (and costs) unwind to face value by maturity. Fair value changes ignored."]},"fvtpl":{"result":"FVTPL (held for trading)","body":["Initial: fair value; {x|transaction costs} **expensed**.","- **All** fair value changes go to P&L."]},"fvd":{"result":"FVTPL (designated)","body":["Initial: fair value; {x|transaction costs} **expensed**.","- Fair value changes to P&L, **except** the part caused by changes in the entity’s **own credit risk**, which goes to {e|Own credit reserve (OCI)}."]},"eq":{"result":"Equity, not a liability","body":["{e|Ordinary shares} give a residual interest with no obligation to pay. {e|Share capital} is outside this chapter."]},"nf":{"result":"A non-financial liability","body":["{l|Provisions} (SFRS(I) 1-37), {l|tax payable} (SFRS(I) 1-12), {l|contract liabilities} (SFRS(I) 15). Real liabilities, measured under their own standards."]}},"id":"tree-urawdw","sect":1,"part":"Classify","svg":"\u003csvg width=\"100%\" style=\"min-width:629px\" role=\"img\"\n viewBox=\"0.00 0.00 572.00 348.00\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n\u003cg id=\"graph0\" class=\"graph\" transform=\"scale(1 1) rotate(0) translate(10.8 337.47)\">\n\u003ctitle>G\u003c/title>\n\u003cpolygon fill=\"white\" stroke=\"none\" points=\"-10.8,10.8 -10.8,-337.47 560.77,-337.47 560.77,10.8 -10.8,10.8\"/>\n\n\u003cg id=\"node1\" class=\"node\">\n\u003ctitle>n1\u003c/title>\n\u003cpath fill=\"#fef3c7\" stroke=\"#b45309\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" d=\"M409.65,-326.67C409.65,-326.67 286.62,-326.67 286.62,-326.67 280.62,-326.67 274.62,-320.67 274.62,-314.67 274.62,-314.67 274.62,-294.03 274.62,-294.03 274.62,-288.03 280.62,-282.03 286.62,-282.03 286.62,-282.03 409.65,-282.03 409.65,-282.03 415.65,-282.03 421.65,-288.03 421.65,-294.03 421.65,-294.03 421.65,-314.67 421.65,-314.67 421.65,-320.67 415.65,-326.67 409.65,-326.67\"/>\n\u003ctext xml:space=\"preserve\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"348.14\" y=\"-311.9\" font-family=\"Helvetica,sans-Serif\" font-size=\"11.00\" fill=\"#111827\">Must the entity deliver cash\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext xml:space=\"preserve\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"348.14\" y=\"-299.9\" font-family=\"Helvetica,sans-Serif\" font-size=\"11.00\" fill=\"#111827\">(or another financial asset)\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext xml:space=\"preserve\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"348.14\" y=\"-287.9\" font-family=\"Helvetica,sans-Serif\" font-size=\"11.00\" fill=\"#111827\">under a contract?\u003c/text>\n\u003c/g>\n\n\u003cg id=\"node2\" class=\"node\">\n\u003ctitle>trade\u003c/title>\n\u003cpath fill=\"#fef3c7\" stroke=\"#b45309\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" d=\"M262.65,-211.03C262.65,-211.03 139.62,-211.03 139.62,-211.03 133.62,-211.03 