&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Year 1&quot;,&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;market rates&quot;,&quot;el&quot;:&quot;x&quot;,&quot;v&quot;:90000,&quot;cap&quot;:&quot;Market rates fall, so the fixed payments are worth more: {l|liability} +90,000, a {x|fair value loss} in **P&amp;L** under both.&quot;},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;own credit&quot;,&quot;el&quot;:&quot;i&quot;,&quot;v&quot;:-30000,&quot;cap&quot;:&quot;Own credit worsens: {l|liability} −30,000, and for a trading liability this {i|gain} goes straight to **P&amp;L**. Closing {l|2,060,000}.&quot;}]}]},{&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Designated at FVTPL&quot;,&quot;sub&quot;:&quot;own credit → OCI&quot;,&quot;el&quot;:&quot;l&quot;,&quot;bal&quot;:&quot;Fair value&quot;,&quot;start&quot;:2000000,&quot;startCap&quot;:&quot;Issued at par: {l|2,000,000}.&quot;,&quot;years&quot;:[{&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Year 1&quot;,&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;market rates&quot;,&quot;el&quot;:&quot;x&quot;,&quot;v&quot;:90000,&quot;cap&quot;:&quot;Market rates fall, so the fixed payments are worth more: {l|liability} +90,000, a {x|fair value loss} in **P&amp;L** under both.&quot;},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;own credit&quot;,&quot;el&quot;:&quot;e&quot;,&quot;v&quot;:-30000,&quot;cap&quot;:&quot;The issuer’s own credit worsens: {l|liability} −30,000. This {i|gain} goes to the {e|Own credit reserve (OCI)}, not profit. Closing {l|2,060,000}.&quot;}]}]}],&quot;notes&quot;:{&quot;start&quot;:&quot;The same note, the same fair value change (2,000,000 → 2,060,000), two categories. Press Play or Next.&quot;,&quot;parts&quot;:[&quot;Step 1: the market-rate part of the change. P&amp;L either way.&quot;,&quot;Step 2: the own-credit part. This is where the two categories split.&quot;],&quot;end&quot;:&quot;Same {l|closing liability} 2,060,000. Held for trading: net {x|P&amp;L loss} 60,000. Designated: {x|P&amp;L loss} 90,000 and an {e|OCI} gain of 30,000, so a downgrade never flatters profit.&quot;}}\">\u003c/div>","id":"visual-1q2eo3","sect":4,"part":"Subsequent measurement"},{"id":"je-jn3nu2","type":"je","bucket":"subsequent","lo":36,"q":"A bank issued a note at par for $2,000,000 and designated it at FVTPL. Record its year-end remeasurement: fair value rises from $2,000,000 to $2,060,000. Of the change, a $30,000 decrease is caused by the bank’s worsening own credit; the rest comes from market rates.","accounts":["Financial liability at FVTPL","Cash","Fair value loss (P&L)","Fair value gain (P&L)","Own credit reserve (OCI)","Retained earnings","Interest expense"],"lines":[{"side":"Dr","account":"Fair value loss (P&L)","amount":90000},{"side":"Cr","account":"Financial liability at FVTPL","amount":60000},{"side":"Cr","account":"Own credit reserve (OCI)","amount":30000}],"why":"{l|Liability} up 60,000. Market-rate {x|loss} 60,000 + 30,000 = 90,000 to P&L; the 30,000 own-credit {i|gain} to OCI.","sect":4,"part":"Subsequent measurement"},{"type":"compare","bucket":"subsequent","special":"Amortised cost via the effective interest rate: a {l|premium} cuts the {x|expense}, a {l|discount} adds to it. FVTPL only for trading or designated {l|liabilities}, with own credit sent to OCI.","id":"compare-1kumyt-3","sect":4,"part":"Subsequent measurement"},{"type":"map","id":"map-5-derecognise","bucket":"derecognise","sect":5,"part":"Derecognise / transfer"},{"id":"think-1vp05l","type":"think","bucket":"derecognise","lo":35,"scenario":"On 31 Dec 20X1, right after paying the coupon, a bond with face value $1,000,000 (issued at a premium) is carried at $1,036,668. Interest rates have fallen, so the company buys the whole issue back early from investors for $1,045,000.","prompt":"Is there a gain or a loss? Against what amount do you compare the $1,045,000?","answer":["Compare the {a|cash paid} with the **{l|carrying amount}**, not the face value. It paid 1,045,000 to settle a {l|liability} carried at 1,036,668: a **{x|loss} of $8,332**, to P&L.","Comparing with face gives a {x|loss} of 45,000, which ignores the 36,668 {l|premium} still on the books."],"sect":5,"part":"Derecognise / transfer"},{"type":"rule","bucket":"derecognise","lo":35,"title":"Derecognition","body":["The bond has been issued, priced and rolled forward. The last step of its life is leaving the books, either at maturity or early, as in the buy-back on the previous page.","Derecognise a {l|financial liability} when the obligation is **extinguished**: **discharged** (paid), **cancelled**, or **expires**.","> {i|Gain} or {x|loss} = {l|carrying amount} − {a|consideration paid}   (to P&L)","- **At maturity:** the {l|carrying amount} equals face, so paying face in {a|cash} gives no {i|gain} or {x|loss}.","- **Early repayment:** compare the {a|cash} with the **{l|amortised cost}** on that date (after bringing {x|interest} up to date).","! Use the {l|carrying amount}, not face value. {l|Unamortised premium}, {l|discount} and {l|issue costs} are part of it."],"id":"rule-11pxwg","sect":5,"part":"Derecognise / transfer"},{"type":"diagram","bucket":"derecognise","lo":35,"title":"Timeline: issue, carry, buy back early","intro":"The notes bond from issue to the early buy-back.","notes":{"iss":"Received {a|cash} of 1,053,460 for a {l|bond} with face 1,000,000.","ye":"After a year of effective {x|interest} and the first {a|coupon}, the {l|carrying amount} is 1,036,668. Always bring {x|interest} up to date before derecognising.","int":"{x|Interest expense}: {l|opening} 1,053,460 × 6% = 63,208, charged before the buy-back.","bb":"The company pays investors 1,045,000 in {a|cash} to cancel the {l|bond}.","out":"The whole {l|carrying amount} comes out: Dr {l|Bonds payable} 1,036,668 (gross form: 1,000,000 face + 36,668 {l|premium left}).","loss":"Paid more than the {l|carrying amount}: Dr {x|Loss on derecognition (P&L)} 8,332."},"walk":[{"nodes":["iss","ye","int"],"text":"Issue for 1,053,460; a year of {x|interest} takes the {l|carrying amount} to 1,036,668."},{"nodes":["bb","out"],"text":"Buy back for {a|cash} of 1,045,000: take the 1,036,668 {l|carrying amount} off the books."},{"nodes":["bb","loss"],"text":"The 8,332 difference is a {x|loss} in P&L."}],"id":"diagram-a60fh5","sect":5,"part":"Derecognise / transfer","svg":"\u003csvg width=\"100%\" style=\"min-width:477px\" role=\"img\"\n viewBox=\"0.00 0.00 434.00 248.00\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n\u003cg id=\"graph0\" class=\"graph\" transform=\"scale(1 1) rotate(0) translate(14.4 233.4)\">\n\u003ctitle>G\u003c/title>\n\u003cpolygon fill=\"white\" stroke=\"none\" points=\"-14.4,14.4 -14.4,-233.4 419.8,-233.4 419.8,14.4 -14.4,14.4\"/>\n\n\u003cg id=\"node1\" class=\"node\">\n\u003ctitle>iss\u003c/title>\n\u003cpath fill=\"#1f3a5f\" stroke=\"#1f3a5f\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" d=\"M324.78,-219C324.78,-219 255,-219 255,-219 249,-219 243,-213 243,-207 243,-207 243,-195 243,-195 243,-189 249,-183 255,-183 255,-183 324.78,-183 324.78,-183 330.78,-183 336.78,-189 336.78,-195 336.78,-195 336.78,-207 336.78,-207 336.78,-213 330.78,-219 324.78,-219\"/>\n\u003ctext xml:space=\"preserve\" text-anchor=\"start\" x=\"261.76\" y=\"-202.55\" font-family=\"Helvetica,sans-Serif\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"11.00\" fill=\"white\">1 Jan 20X1\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext xml:space=\"preserve\" text-anchor=\"start\" x=\"251.64\" y=\"-191.55\" font-family=\"Helvetica,sans-Serif\" font-size=\"11.00\" fill=\"white\">Issue 1,053,460\u003c/text>\n\u003c/g>\n\n\u003cg id=\"node2\" class=\"node\">\n\u003ctitle>ye\u003c/title>\n\u003cpath fill=\"#1f3a5f\" stroke=\"#1f3a5f\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" d=\"M332.65,-158C332.65,-158 247.12,-158 247.12,-158 241.12,-158 235.12,-152 235.12,-146 235.12,-146 235.12,-134 235.12,-134 235.12,-128 241.12,-122 247.12,-122 247.12,-122 332.65,-122 332.65,-122 338.65,-122 344.65,-128 344.65,-134 344.65,-134 344.65,-146 344.65,-146 344.65,-152 338.65,-158 332.65,-158\"/>\n\u003ctext xml:space=\"preserve\" text-anchor=\"start\" x=\"258.01\" y=\"-141.55\" font-family=\"Helvetica,sans-S