2 months to turn into cash.","opts":[{"t":"Yes","to":"aCur"},{"t":"No","to":"a2"}]},"a2":{"q":"Is it held mainly **for trading**, or due to be realised within **12 months**, or unrestricted **{a|cash}**?","why":"Any one of the remaining three tests makes an {a|asset} current.","opts":[{"t":"Yes, at least one","to":"aCur"},{"t":"No to all","to":"aNon"}]},"aCur":{"result":"{a|Current asset}","body":["- {a|Inventories}, {a|trade receivables} (net of the {a|allowance}), {a|prepayments}, {a|FVTPL securities} held for trading or sale within the year, {a|cash and cash equivalents}."]},"aNon":{"result":"{a|Non-current asset}","body":["- {a|PPE}, {a|investment property}, {a|intangibles}, {a|long-term financial assets}."]},"l1":{"q":"Is it settled in the **normal operating cycle** ({l|trade payables}, {l|operating accruals}) or held for trading?","why":"Working-capital liabilities are current regardless of the 12-month test.","opts":[{"t":"Yes","to":"lCur"},{"t":"No (it is a {l|borrowing}, {l|bond}, {l|lease}, {l|provision}…)","to":"l3"}]},"l3":{"q":"Is any of it **due within 12 months** of the reporting date, including because it is **repayable on demand**?","why":"A covenant breach on or before the reporting date that makes a {l|loan} repayable on demand counts as due now.","opts":[{"t":"Yes","to":"l4"},{"t":"No, all due after 12 months","to":"lNon"}]},"l4":{"q":"**At the reporting date**, did the entity have a right to defer settlement for at least 12 months?","why":"Only rights that exist at the reporting date count. A waiver or refinancing agreed after year end comes too late.","opts":[{"t":"Yes, the right existed at year end","to":"lNon"},{"t":"No, or only agreed after year end","to":"lCur"}]},"lCur":{"result":"{l|Current liability}","body":["- In the scenario: the breach on 20 December made the {l|loan} repayable on demand at 31 December, and the bank’s 15 January agreement came after the reporting date. So the whole $2m is **current**.","- Disclose the post-year-end waiver as a non-adjusting event.","! Using the after-year-end waiver to keep it non-current is the classic trap."]},"lNon":{"result":"{l|Non-current liability}","body":["- Only the part not due within 12 months, with no breach. The current portion of a {l|loan} or {l|lease} (next year’s instalments) is split out as current."]}},"sect":4,"part":"Financial position: current or not","svg":"\u003csvg width=\"100%\" style=\"min-width:640px\" role=\"img\"\n viewBox=\"0.00 0.00 629.00 481.00\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n\u003cg id=\"graph0\" class=\"graph\" transform=\"scale(1 1) rotate(0) translate(10.8 469.97)\">\n\u003ctitle>G\u003c/title>\n\u003cpolygon fill=\"white\" stroke=\"none\" points=\"-10.8,10.8 -10.8,-469.97 617.72,-469.97 617.72,10.8 -10.8,10.8\"/>\n\n\u003cg id=\"node1\" class=\"node\">\n\u003ctitle>n1\u003c/title>\n\u003cpath fill=\"#fef3c7\" stroke=\"#b45309\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" d=\"M257.4,-459.17C257.4,-459.17 138.88,-459.17 138.88,-459.17 132.88,-459.17 126.87,-453.17 126.87,-447.17 126.87,-447.17 126.87,-435.17 126.87,-435.17 126.87,-429.17 132.87,-423.17 138.87,-423.17 138.87,-423.17 257.4,-423.17 257.4,-423.17 263.4,-423.17 269.4,-429.17 269.4,-435.17 269.4,-435.17 269.4,-447.17 269.4,-447.17 269.4,-453.17 263.4,-459.17 257.4,-459.17\"/>\n\u003ctext xml:space=\"preserve\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"198.14\" y=\"-436.72\" font-family=\"Helvetica,sans-Serif\" font-size=\"11.00\" fill=\"#111827\">What kind of balance is it?\u003c/text>\n\u003c/g>\n\n\u003cg id=\"node2\" class=\"node\">\n\u003ctitle>dt\u003c/title>\n\u003cpath fill=\"#e6f4f1\" stroke=\"#0f766e\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" d=\"M98.28,-358.35C98.28,-358.35 12,-358.35 12,-358.35 6,-358.35 0,-352.35 0,-346.35 0,-346.35 0,-334.35 0,-334.35 0,-328.35 6,-322.35 12,-322.35 12,-322.35 98.28,-322.35 98.28,-322.35 104.28,-322.35 110.28,-328.35 110.28,-334.35 110.28,-334.35 110.28,-346.35 110.28,-346.35 110.28,-352.35 104.28,-358.35 98.28,-358.35\"/