, unless specifically identified with investing or financing."]},"n2":{"q":"Is it part of the main **revenue-producing** activities ({i|sales}, {a|inventory}, {x|wages}, {x|rent})?","why":"Operating is the default home for the day-to-day business.","opts":[{"t":"Yes","to":"op"},{"t":"No","to":"n3"}]},"op":{"result":"Operating activities","body":["- Cash from customers; paid to suppliers (including **{a|inventory}**) and employees; {x|rent}; {x|tax} paid."]},"n3":{"q":"Is it buying or selling **long-term assets** or investments, or **lending to others** (and getting that {a|loan} back)?","why":"Investing is spending now for returns later, including money lent out.","opts":[{"t":"Yes","to":"inv"},{"t":"No","to":"n4"}]},"inv":{"result":"Investing activities","body":["- In the scenario: the $80,000 {a|loan} **to** the supplier is an investing outflow. When it is repaid, the principal is an investing inflow.","- Also: buying or selling {a|PPE}, {a|intangibles} and {a|land}; buying shares or bonds of other entities."]},"n4":{"q":"Does it change the entity’s **own {e|equity} or {l|borrowings}**?","why":"Financing is the money that funds the entity: owners and lenders.","opts":[{"t":"Yes","to":"fin"},{"t":"No","to":"op"}]},"fin":{"result":"Financing activities","body":["- Issuing or buying back {e|shares}; {l|borrowing}; repaying {l|loan principal}; redeeming {l|debentures} (including any premium); {l|lease principal} payments."]}},"id":"tree-f5dntj","sect":5,"part":"Cash flows: which activity?","svg":"\u003csvg width=\"100%\" style=\"min-width:640px\" role=\"img\"\n viewBox=\"0.00 0.00 588.00 533.00\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n\u003cg id=\"graph0\" class=\"graph\" transform=\"scale(1 1) rotate(0) translate(10.8 522.58)\">\n\u003ctitle>G\u003c/title>\n\u003cpolygon fill=\"white\" stroke=\"none\" points=\"-10.8,10.8 -10.8,-522.58 577.33,-522.58 577.33,10.8 -10.8,10.8\"/>\n\n\u003cg id=\"node1\" class=\"node\">\n\u003c