its {a|book amount}.","a2":"The bankruptcy doesn’t create the problem. It **reveals** it.","a3":"Adjust: Dr {x|Impairment loss on receivables} / Cr {a|Allowance for doubtful debts}.","b1":"At year end the {a|warehouse} was intact. Nothing to fix in the 20X5 numbers.","b2":"The fire is a **new** condition, arising in 20X6.","b3":"Disclose the nature and estimated effect. The {x|loss} is booked in 20X6."},"walk":[{"nodes":["h2","a2","b2"],"text":"Both events happen on the **same day**, after year end. The event date can’t tell them apart."},{"nodes":["h1","a1","b1"],"text":"So look back to **31 December**. The customer was already in trouble; the {a|warehouse} was fine."},{"nodes":["a1","a2","a3"],"text":"Customer: the bankruptcy **revealed** an existing condition → **adjusting**."},{"nodes":["b1","b2","b3"],"text":"Warehouse: the fire **created** a new condition → **non-adjusting**."}],"caption":"The event date is the same; the condition date is not.","id":"diagram-1n6f1h","sect":2,"part":"Adjusting events","svg":"\u003csvg width=\"100%\" style=\"min-width:501px\" role=\"img\"\n viewBox=\"0.00 0.00 455.00 192.00\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n\u003cg id=\"graph0\" class=\"graph\" transform=\"scale(1 1) rotate(0) translate(10.8 180.8)\">\n\u003ctitle>G\u003c/title>\n\u003cpolygon fill=\"white\" stroke=\"none\" points=\"-10.8,10.8 -10.8,-180.8 444.64,-180.8 444.64,10.8 -10.8,10.8\"/>\n\n\u003cg id=\"node1\" class=\"node\">\n\u003ctitle>h1\u003c/title>\n\u003cpath fill=\"#1f3a5f\" stroke=\"#1f3a5f\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" d=\"M91.15,-36C91.15,-36 19.12,-36 19.12,-36 13.12,-36 7.12,-30 7.12,-24 7.12,-24 7.12,-12 7.12,-12 7.12,-6 13.12,0 19.12,0 19.12,0 91.15,0 91.15,0 97.15,0 103.15,-6 103.15,-12 103.15,-12 103.15,-24 103.15,-24 103.15,-30 97.15,-36 91.15,-36\"/>\n\u003ctext xml:space=\"preserve\" text-anchor=\"start\" x=\"15.76\" y=\"-18.55\" font-family=\"Helvetica,sans-Serif\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"11.00\