e of a condition that already existed at the reporting date?","why":"This is the heart of the standard: the timing of the **condition**, not of the event, decides.","opts":[{"t":"Yes: it was already true at year end, we just found out later","to":"adj"},{"t":"No: the condition arose after year end","to":"mat"}]},"mat":{"q":"Is it material?","why":"Non-adjusting events never change the numbers. Materiality only decides whether the notes must mention it.","opts":[{"t":"Yes","to":"nonD"},{"t":"No","to":"nonN"}]},"late":{"result":"Outside these FS","body":["Once the FS are authorised for issue, the window has closed. The event is dealt with in **next year’s** FS."]},"early":{"result":"Not an event after the reporting period","body":["It happened during the year, so it is an ordinary transaction of that year: record it in the normal way."]},"nogc":{"result":"Don’t use the going concern basis","body":["The one post-year-end event that changes the **whole basis** of the FS, not just one balance.","- Disclose that the FS are not on a going concern basis, the basis used, and why."]},"div":{"result":"Not a liability: disclose in the notes","body":["No obligation existed at the reporting date, so there is no {l|Dividend payable} and no {x|expense}.","- Disclose the dividend in the notes. It becomes a {l|liability} in the year it is declared."]},"adj":{"result":"Adjusting event: change the amounts","body":["The event is better evidence about a balance that existed at the reporting date, so update that balance.","- e.g. impair the {a|receivable}, write {a|inventory} down to NRV, adjust the {l|provision}."]},"nonD":{"result":"Non-adjusting: disclose, don’t adjust","body":["Leave the year-end amounts alone. In the notes give the event’s **nature** and an **estimate of its financial effect** (or say that no estimate can be made)."]},"nonN":{"result":"Non-adjusting and immaterial: nothing needed","body":["No adjustment, and too small to need a note."]}},"id":"tree-5nny6q","sect":4,"