tion of monetary. Only those items carry real exchange risk until settled.","opts":[{"t":"Yes: {a|cash}, a {a|receivable}, a {l|payable}, a {l|loan}, a cash-settled {l|provision}","to":"mon"},{"t":"No: it will be settled in goods or services (a {a|prepayment} or an {l|advance received})","to":"n2"},{"t":"No: it is a physical or intangible {a|asset}, or an {a|equity share}","to":"n2"}]},"n2":{"q":"Is the item measured at historical cost or at fair value?","why":"Non-monetary items keep whichever rate matches their measurement date.","opts":[{"t":"Historical cost (including {a|inventory}, {a|prepayments} and {a|PPE} under the cost model)","to":"hist"},{"t":"Fair value ({a|revalued PPE}, {a|investment property} under the FV model, {a|shares})","to":"n3"}]},"n3":{"q":"Where does the item’s own fair value gain or loss go?","why":"The FX part follows the item’s own gain or loss.","opts":[{"t":"OCI: a revaluation of {a|PPE}","to":"fvoci"},{"t":"P&L: {a|investment property} under the fair value model, {a|shares} at FVTPL","to":"fvpl"}]},"mon":{"result":"Monetary: closing rate, difference to P&L","body":["Retranslate at the **closing rate** at every reporting date until it is settled.","- The change is a {i|Foreign exchange gain} or {x|Foreign exchange loss} in profit or loss.","- On settlement, any further difference also goes to profit or loss."]},"hist":{"result":"Non-monetary at cost: historical rate, no retranslation","body":["Keep the S$ amount recorded on the transaction date. No exchange difference arises.","- A deposit for goods is a {a|Prepayment}: Orchid will get parts, not dollars back.","- {x|Depreciation} is based on the {a|historical S$ cost}.","+ {a|Inventory} still gets the LCNRV test: {a|cost} at the historical rate vs NRV at the rate when NRV is measured."]},"fvoci":{"result":"Non-monetary at fair value: FV-date rate, FX to OCI","body":["Translate the {a|fair value} at the rate on the **revaluation date**.","- The whole S$ change, FX part included, goes to {e|Revaluation surplus (OCI)}."]},"fvpl":{"result":"Non-monetary at fair value: FV-date rate, FX to P&L","body":["Translate the {a|fair value} at the rate on the date it was measured.","- The whole S$ change, FX part included, goes to profit or loss with the {i|fair value gain} or {x|loss}."]}},"sect":3,"part":"Year end: monetary or not?","svg":"\u003csvg width=\"100%\" style=\"min-width:551px\" role=\"img\"\n viewBox=\"0.00 0.00 501.00 459.00\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n\u003cg id=\"graph0\" class=\"graph\" transform=\"scale(1 1) rotate(0) translate(10.8 448.11)\">\n\u003ctitle>G\u003c/title>\n\u003cpolygon fill=\"white\" stroke=\"none\" points=\"-10.8,10.8 -10.8,-448.11 490.62,-448.11 490.62,10.8 -10.8,10.8\"/>\n\n\u003cg id=\"node1\" class=\"node\">\n\u003ctitle>n1\u003c/title>\n\u003cpath fill=\"#fef3c7\" stroke=\"#b45309\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" d=\"M360.15,-437.31C360.15,-437.31 240.12,-437.31 240.12,-437.31 234.12,-437.31 228.12,-431.31 228.12,-425.31 228.12,-425.31 228.12,-392.67 228.12,-392.67 228.12,-386.67 234.12,-380.67 240.12,-380.67 240.12,-380.67 360.15,-380.67 360.15,-380.67 366.15,-380.67 372.15,-386.67 372.15,-392.67 372.15,-392.67 372.15,-425.31 372.15,-425.31 372.15,-431.31 366.15,-437.31 360.15,-437.31\"/>\n\u003ctext xml:space=\"preserve\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"300.14\" y=\"-422.54\" font-family=\"Helvetica,sans-Serif\" font-size=\"11.00\" fill=\"#111827\">Will it be settled by\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext xml:space=\"preserve\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"300.14\" y=\"-410.54\" font-family=\"Helvetica,sans-Serif\" font-size=\"11.00\" fill=\"#111827\">receiving or paying a fixed\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext xml:space=\"preserve\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"300.14\" y=\"-398.54\" font-family=\"Helvetica,sans-Serif\" font-size=\"11.00\" fill=\"#111827\">or determinable number of\u003c/text>\n\u003ctext xml:space=\"preserve\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"300.14\" y=\"-386.54\" font-family=\"Helvetic